Law texts

The texts in this repository are Peraturan Daerah (Perda) of Provinsi Sulawesi Utara (Indonesia) as enacted, from the copies (salinan) published by
JDIH Provinsi Sulawesi Utara (Biro Hukum Sekretariat Daerah Provinsi Sulawesi Utara) on https://jdih.sulutprov.go.id.

- Copyright: Undang-Undang Nomor 28 Tahun 2014 tentang Hak Cipta, Pasal 42:
  "Tidak ada Hak Cipta atas hasil karya berupa: a. hasil rapat terbuka lembaga negara; b. peraturan perundang-undangan; c. pidato kenegaraan atau pidato pejabat Pemerintah; d. putusan pengadilan atau penetapan hakim; dan e. kitab suci atau simbol keagamaan."
  ("There is no copyright in works consisting of: ... b. laws and regulations; ..."). A Peraturan Daerah Provinsi
  (in Aceh, a Qanun Aceh) is one of the peraturan perundang-undangan listed in Undang-Undang Nomor 12 Tahun 2011,
  Pasal 7(1).
- The JDIH website carries no copyright line (its catalogue marks each dataset "License: Creative Commons Attribution") and no terms that restrict reuse of the regulations it publishes.
- The texts are reproduced without change to their wording; only the arrangement (one file per Pasal, one paragraph
  per line) is Lexifina's. Neither the Government of Provinsi Sulawesi Utara nor JDIH endorses this repository.

Attribution: Source: JDIH Provinsi Sulawesi Utara (Biro Hukum Sekretariat Daerah Provinsi Sulawesi Utara), https://jdih.sulutprov.go.id.

